alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle sat at 24% of normal for January to February and 40% for November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 25041 down to 48% that year. On grid 25039 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 144.3, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
